<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scurrīlis</span></b> , e, adj.
		scurra, II., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>buffoonlike</i>, <i>jeering</i>, <i>scurrilous.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jocus (with mimicus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 2, 59, 239</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dicacitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 60, 244</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 6, 3, 29</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 22</span></i> (with sordida); <i><span class="en">Cic. de
				Or. 3, 60, 245</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 6, 3, 48</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 7,
				8, 9</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In gen., <i>jesting</i>, <i>facetious</i>, <i>ludicrous</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lusus (opp. res seriae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 8, 8, 2</span></i>
			.— 
			<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scurrīlĭter</span></b>  (acc. to I.), <i>like a buffoon</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ludere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 4, 25, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jocari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					24, 6, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
